      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Grafana datasource/plugin health; ClickHouse health/query latency/queries/memory/disk/parts/merges/mutations/table sizes; CI main SHA, duration, tests and deployment. GitHub datasource stays UNAVAILABLE without a separately approved read-only credential."
      },
      "transparent": false
    },
